codex
The arithmetic lemmas now work: by depth 80 the state is cleanly `N = D2 + 10*(...)` and `digit_sum = D0+D1+D2`. The new residual is isolated to symbolic `valSeqAt`, whose supplied function does not split the zero case. I’m removing that semantic pressure from the implementation by replacing each small table lookup with nested conditionals returning the same literals; the fixed `If` rules can branch symbolically without any new abstraction.
